# Auto-push to GitHub

After finishing a task that includes code changes in this repo:

1. Run `git status` and commit any meaningful changes (do not commit secrets).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`git push origin HEAD`).
3. Briefly tell the user the commit hash and that Vercel will auto-deploy from GitHub.

Do this without waiting for the user to ask, unless they explicitly say not to push.

Do not force-push. Do not push if there are no changes to commit.
